  "description": "Inserts until a data page fills: six single inserts of 520-byte rows into G (five rows on a page with room for two). Asks at which insert a new data page is added and what else changes (ownership and allocation pages, index) at that insert and at the ones before it. Images: 'before' (the fixture copy as given), then one kept image of the closed file after each step; every step opens the database read/write, makes one mutation and closes it.",
